    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Part 8 In-house asset rules applying to regulated superannuation funds Division 2 Historical cost ratio of fund's in-house assets ",
            "block_bbox": [
                146,
                2,
                823,
                58
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 79",
            "block_bbox": [
                149,
                96,
                276,
                120
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) At all times during the fund's 1994-95 year of income when the fund was in existence, the historical cost ratio of the fund's in-house assets must not exceed 10%.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                242,
                161,
                953,
                241
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "79 Public sector funds established before 1 July 1990-historical cost ratio for the 1994-95 year of income ",
            "block_bbox": [
                152,
                278,
                949,
                334
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) This section applies to a regulated superannuation fund, if the fund is a public sector fund established before 1 July 1990.",
            "block_bbox": [
                241,
                356,
                998,
                409
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) At all times during the fund's 1994-95 year of income when the fund was in existence, the historical cost ratio of the fund's in-house assets must not exceed whichever is the greater of the following percentages:",
            "block_bbox": [
                241,
                433,
                967,
                544
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) the percentage equal to the historical cost ratio of the fund's in-house assets as at the end of 1 July 1990;",
            "block_bbox": [
                300,
                551,
                995,
                604
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) 10%.",
            "block_bbox": [
                300,
                617,
                407,
                642
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Section 72 is to be ignored in working out the percentage mentioned in paragraph (2)(a).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                237,
                665,
                907,
                719
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "80 All funds-historical cost ratio for the 1995-96 year of income,the 1996-97 year of income and the 1997-98 year of income \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                144,
                756,
                982,
                845
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) This section applies to a regulated superannuation fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                239,
                868,
                900,
                895
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) At all times during the period:",
            "block_bbox": [
                241,
                918,
                623,
                942
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) beginning at the beginning of the fund's 1995-96 year of income; and \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                303,
                946,
                982,
                1000
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) ending at the end of the fund's 1997-98 year of income;when the fund was in existence, the historical cost ratio of the fund's in-house assets must not exceed 10%.",
            "block_bbox": [
                293,
